            "review_title": "Review at Infinity Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Grace W\n2 contributions\n0\nRubbish service, average food\nFeb 2019 • Friends\n4 of us went for a late lunch. Food started to arrive and the chips were cold! Two of us had not tasty beef salad and an average chicken burger (complete with cold fries). To kick it all off the spring rolls which we ordered hadnt arrived an hour later when we finished eating so we assumed they had been forgotten and asked for the bill. We suited the charge of the spring rolls (since they never came) and suddenly they arrived, over an hour after We ordered them and we'll after We had finished eating. A struggle to sort out. Won't be back and do not reccomend\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 12, 2019",
