            "review_title": "Review at Infinity Restaurant",
            "review_text": "screennameanon1554\n50 contributions\n0\nBeachfront, quality, reasonable prices\nJan 2019 • Family\nThis restaurant is located on the beachfront, yet lacks the beachfront prices. The menu is diverse, but nothing for vegetarians/vegan other than the sides of veg. Service was quick and the staff were amazing and lovely, with the food being served hot and fresh. The only downside was food arrives when cooked, so if you order starters, chances are you'll get them with or after your main courses, despite having a starters menu. Bottles if alcohol can be bought for cheap here too, with 500ml bottles of vodka for only 120k dong (about £4/5 for the bottle) when other local bars are selling a single vodka and mixer for the same price.\nRead more\nWritten January 15, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
